# T-974: Ok and Error constructors now use qualified tags ("Result.Ok", "Result.Error").
# Pattern matching [Ok v] / [Error _] with unqualified tags no longer matches qualified
# variants until T-968 (elaboration pass) is implemented.
# After T-968 these patterns will be qualified to [Result.Ok v] / [Result.Error _].
[ok-val: [Ok 42]
 error-val: [Error "oops"]
 ok-result: [match ok-val
   [case [let v] [Result.Ok v] v]
   [Result.Error _]: 0]
 error-result: [match error-val
   [case [let v] [Result.Ok v] v]
   [Result.Error _]: -1]]
=== out
Dict({"ok-val": Variant(Result.Ok, Int(42)), "error-val": Variant(Result.Error, String("oops")), "ok-result": Int(42), "error-result": Int(-1)})
